; form-glass-organs-child.fk — the organs process the events/channels band spawns: three ticks into the band's own
; space (keyed under the TMPDIR the band hands it), then it stays a moment so the band can take the frame
; from a process that is still alive, and answers how many ticks it gave.
; PROOF LEVEL: FOURTH-ARM ONLY — the membrane rides fkwu's shared-memory gift doors, which no sibling kernel carries.
; Verdict 3
; preludes: form/form-stdlib/form-glass-organs.bml

(do
    (let done (fgor-run-ticks (str_concat (temp_dir) "/form-glass-organs-band") 3 (fgor-state-empty)))
    (host_sleep_ms 5000)
    (fgor-state-tick done))
